bk2535 datasheet
The BK2535 from Beken Corporation is a 2.4 GHz RF System-on-Chip (SoC) combining an 8051-compatible FLIP51 microcontroller and a high-performance wireless transceiver. It is widely used in wireless keyboards, multi-function "air" remote controls, and short-range data transmission devices. 

