Core Hardware Features
Microcontroller: FLIP51 (8051 compatible) with a 4-stage pipeline executing most instructions in a single clock cycle.
Memory: 32 KB Flash program memory, 256 Bytes IRAM, and 2 KB SRAM.
RF Transceiver: Integrated 2.4 GHz radio frequency transceiver.
Operating Voltage: 1.8 V to 3.6 V power supply with an embedded booster.
Peripherals: Supports UART, I2C, and SPI interfaces, 8-channel ADC, total 40 GPIOs, dedicated PWM channels, and USB functionality.
Security & Debug: On-chip AES encryption, pseudo-random number generator, and Built-In Real-time Debugger (BIRD) system. 
