The Turnaround Phase: The line undergoes a rapid high-impedance reversal. The 24-pin chip stops driving the wire and converts its pin to a listener.
The Matrix Payload: The 14-pin matrix encoder drives the shared line, shifting out an exact 8-byte USB-HID standard report (Modifier key byte, Reserved padding byte, and 6 active concurrent Keycode arrays) [index:1.1.3]. 
